"Each institution has a routing number. Enter it here. If uncertain, leave "
"the field blank. You can modify it later."
msgstr ""
"Elk Bank hett en Bankleddtall, de Du hier ingeven kannst. Wenn Du nich seker "
"büst, laat dit man leddig. Du kannst dat later noch ännern."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel3)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:66
msgid "Name of the institution"
msgstr "Naam vun de Bank"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel4)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:76
msgid "Routing number"
msgstr "Bankleddtall"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, m_accountNumberEdit)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:86
msgid ""
"In general the institution that issued the account also issued a number for "
"it. Enter it here. If uncertain, you can modify this entry later."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Dien Kontonummer ingeven. Hest Du ehr nich praat, kannst Du "
"dat ok later noch doon."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, m_accountNameEdit)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:93
msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive name that will be used by KMyMoney to identify your "
"checking account."
msgstr ""
"Bitte en beschrieven Naam för dit Konto för den Bruuk mit KMyMoney ingeven."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (kMyMoneyDateInput, m_openingDateEdit)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:112
msgid ""
"Enter the date from when on you plan to keep track of the transactions in "
"that account. This is usually the date of the last statement. If uncertain, "
"leave as is."
msgstr ""
"Bitte dat Datum ingeven, vun dat af Du de Boken plegen wullt. Dat is "
"normalerwies dat Datum op den niegsten Kontouttog. Büst Du nich seker, denn "
"laat dat man so as dat nu is."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:137
msgid "Number of the account"
msgstr "Kontonummer"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:147
msgid "Name of the account"
msgstr "Kontonummer"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (kMyMoneyEdit, m_openingBalanceEdit)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:182
msgid ""
"Enter the opening balance of the account. This is usually the ending balance "
"of the last statement. If uncertain, leave as is."
msgstr ""
"Bitte den Anfangssaldo för dit Konto ingeven. Dat is normalerwies de Saldo "
"op den niegsten Kontouttog. Büst Du nich seker, denn laat dat man so as dat "
"nu is."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kaccountpagedecl.ui:210
msgid ""
"The fields below allow you to enter some information about your checking "
"account. Once this wizard finishes, the account will be created for you "
"within KMyMoney."
msgstr ""
"Nerrn kannst Du noch mehr Daten över Dien Girokonto ingeven. Dat Konto warrt "
"binnen KMyMoney opstellt, sodraad de Hölper beendt is."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel3)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kcurrencypagedecl.ui:23
msgid ""
"KMyMoney supports multiple currencies. Your reports will be based on a "
"default currency which you can select here. The default for new accounts is "
"also the currency you select here."
msgstr ""
"KMyMoney ünnerstütt vele Geldsorten. Dien Berichten baseert op en Standard-"
"Geldsort, de Du hier angeven kannst. Dat is denn ok de Standard-Geldsort för "
"niege Kontos."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kfilepagedecl.ui:20
msgid ""
"KMyMoney will store your financial data in a file on the disk. A standard "
"filename within your KDE user environment will be the default. This is just "
"provided for convenience and you can choose any other location here."
msgstr ""
"Dien Finanzdaten warrt as Datei op de Fastplaat sekert. En Standard-"
"Dateinaam binnen Dien KDE-Brukerümgeven is al vörinstellt. Du kannst hier "
"man ok elk anner Spiekersteed angeven."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_existingFileLabel)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kfilepagedecl.ui:54
msgid ""
"Either the currently selected file exists or the selected directory does not "
"exist. Please make sure, that\n"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>the selected directory exists and</li>\n"
"<li>the filename is not currently used in this directory.</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"De utsöchte Datei is vörhannen, oder de utsöcht Orner is nich vörhannen. "
"Bitte kiek, wat\n"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>dat den utsöchten Orner redig geven deit un</li>\n"
"<li>dat de Dateinaam jüst nich bruukt warrt.</li>\n"
"</ul>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_finishLabel)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kfilepagedecl.ui:70
msgid ""
"This finishes the setup of your KMyMoney environment. You can now press the "
"Finish button and start using KMyMoney to record your financial transactions."
msgstr ""
"Dien KMyMoney-Ümgeven is nu instellt. Du kannst de Instellen nu beennen un "
"KMyMoney starten, wenn Du DienGeldsaken plegen wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kgeneralpagedecl.ui:22
msgid ""
"Please enter some information about yourself.<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"This information will be seen and used only by you. The information is used "
"to personalize KMyMoney, to encrypt your file, etc."
msgstr ""
"Bitte giff en poor persöönliche Daten in.<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"Disse Daten kannst Du bloots alleen ankieken un bruken. Se warrt för't "
"Verslöteln vun Dateien un anner Saken bruukt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel7)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kgeneralpagedecl.ui:104
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/userinfodecl.ui:104
msgctxt "@label email address"
msgid "Email:"
msgstr "Nettpostadress:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel5)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kgeneralpagedecl.ui:165
msgid "Zip code"
msgstr "Postleddtall"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kintropagedecl.ui:26
msgid "Welcome to KMyMoney!"
msgstr "Willkamen bi KMyMoney"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kintropagedecl.ui:41
msgid ""
"You have started KMyMoney for the first time on this computer. Before this "
"program can help you to manage your finances, it needs to collect some data "
"from you.<p>\n"
"\n"
"On the next few pages you will be guided through the steps necessary to "
"setup the program. This will happen only once."
msgstr ""
"Du hest KMyMoney dat eerste Maal op dissen Reekner opropen. Dormit Du nu ok "
"Dien Geldsaken plegen kannst, warrt man noch en poor Daten bruukt.<p>\n"
"\n"
"De nakamen Sieden föhrt Di dör de Programminstellen. Dit warrt bloots "
"eenmaal bruukt."

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:85
msgid "KMyMoney New File Setup"
msgstr "KMyMoney - Nieg Datei opstellen"

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:87
msgctxt "New file wizard introduction"
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:88
msgid "Personal Data"
msgstr "Persöönliche Daten"

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:89
msgid "Select Currency"
msgstr "Geldsort utsöken"

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:90
msgid "Select Accounts"
msgstr "Kontos utsöken"

#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/knewuserwizard.cpp:91
msgid "Set preferences"
msgstr "Vörinstellen fastleggen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kpasswordpagedecl.ui:23
msgid ""
"<p>KMyMoney can encrypt your datafile using GPG Encryption. GPG encryption "
"is one of the most secure methods in the world for protecting data. All of "
"your account numbers and other important financial information will be very "
"secure.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>KMyMoney kann Dien Datendatei mit GPG verslöteln. PGP-Verslöteln is een "
"vun de sekersten Datenschuulmetoden. Dien Kontonummern un anner wichtige "
"Saken sünd bannig seker.</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kpreferencepagedecl.ui:20
msgid ""
"If you would like to review or change any preference settings for KMyMoney "
"after finishing this wizard, you can do so by checking this box. If not just "
"click <b>Next</b>."
msgstr ""
"Wullt Du de Vörinstellen ankieken oder ännern, de disse Hölper maakt hett, "
"denn maak dit Feld an. Wullt Du nix ännern, klick eenfach op <b>Nakamen</b>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_openConfigAfterFinished)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kpreferencepagedecl.ui:32
msgid "Configure preferences after finishing the wizard."
msgstr "Vörinstellen na't Beennen vun den Hölper fastleggen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newuserwizard/kpreferencepagedecl.ui:60
msgid ""
"You can change the configuration options at any time using the configuration "
"dialog. Just select the <b>Configure KMyMoney...</b> option in the "
"<b>Settings</b> menu."
msgstr ""
"De Instellen laat sik jümmers binnen den <b>KMyMoney-Instellendialoog</b> "
"ännern"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/accountsdecl.ui:20
msgid ""
"Select groups of accounts that correspond to the ways that you will use "
"KMyMoney. Each group you select will cause several accounts and categories "
"to be created. Select the groups that are relevant to you. You can always "
"create additional accounts manually later."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/currencydecl.ui:17
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"KMyMoney supports multiple currencies, nevertheless one of them will be used "
"as your base currency. The base currency is used as default for new accounts "
"and reports. Please select the base currency from the following list."
msgstr ""
"KMyMoney ünnerstütt vele Geldsorten, man een warrt as Standard-Geldsort "
"bruukt. Disse Geldsort warrt ok as Standard för niege Kontos un Berichten "
"bruukt. Söök bitte Dien Standard-Geldsort ut de nakamen List ut."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QTreeWidget, m_currencyList)
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/currencydecl.ui:36
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "ISO Code"
msgstr "ISO-Kode"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QTreeWidget, m_currencyList)
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/currencydecl.ui:41
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Symbol"
msgstr "Symbool"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, qLabel1)
#: kmymoney/wizards/wizardpages/userinfodecl.ui:25
msgid ""
"<p>Use the fields below to enter some information about yourself.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>All information is optional and only used to personalize your KMyMoney "
"file.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Nerrn kannst Du en poor persöönliche Informatschonen ingeven.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>De Ingaav is köörwies un warrt bloots för't Topassen vun Dien KMyMoney-"
"Datei bruukt.</p>"

